  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">AVISO DE UTILIDAD PÚBLICA</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Se informa a la comunidad que se encuentra completamente habilitado el sector de la estación de servicio COPEC Maullín.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Tras la finalización de las obras para cubrir la excavación existente, resultado de un acuerdo entre la empresa y el área de medio ambiente, el recinto ha vuelto a estar operativo al 100% de su capacidad <img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/>.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Esta reapertura mejorará el flujo vehicular dentro y fuera de la estación, reduciendo los tiempos de espera para los usuarios <img alt=\"🚗\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tec/1/16/1f697.png\"/>.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">El recinto cuenta con disponibilidad de combustibles Diesel, 97, 95 y 93 octanos, manteniendo su atención continua en modalidad 24/7 <img alt=\"🕒\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/taa/1/16/1f552.png\"/></p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10234\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/h2dh0c9lxlc5mau/copec_09_1024x683_syy4whm90t.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-50 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10235\" data-id=\"10235\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/3zp7dliyzrebthz/copec_02_1024x683_b065nv2wrx.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10240\" data-id=\"10240\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/19qw91jg42sv96o/copec_03_1024x683_x1kj8abz2m.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10237\" data-id=\"10237\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/ocrbzwzlo0fkahu/copec_04_1024x683_87cglilxx6.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10238\" data-id=\"10238\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/rbf6zvvofyd6ph1/copec_05_1024x683_y0319wbwgv.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10241\" data-id=\"10241\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/48ply1t7la128ey/copec_06_1024x683_4m4ewldc6q.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img